"DeStijlation: Reducing to Primary Essence"

This title plays on the word distillation (the process of extracting the essence of something) 
and De Stijl (an art movement known for reducing visual language to basic forms and primary colors).
The phrase "Primary Essence" nods to De Stijl’s focus on primary colors and elemental forms.

